    {"entry_index":20,"uid":"zhcn:7d5f062a2b83dd3c4b3e7058","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"興味深い方々が揃ったわね。\r\n今日は本気が出せるかしら？","source_fingerprint":"fe4e93ea5c4ce363231f1ff20a4db5219c753bce3b57888984460bd7421b6242","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20029"],"target_text":"Những đối thủ thú vị đã tụ họp đủ rồi nhỉ.\r\nHôm nay không biết tôi có thể nghiêm túc hết sức không đây?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":21,"uid":"zhcn:facb00b947f4f46bd10de5a0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ただ走るだけで圧倒する。\r\n強者の姿をお見せするわ。","source_fingerprint":"6d22a1c5898d3a35100d2025c06be8ffe0a79d0c6bedf1bb2ceb7abf92479c94","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20030"],"target_text":"Chỉ cần chạy thôi cũng đủ áp đảo.\r\nTôi sẽ cho anh thấy dáng vẻ của kẻ mạnh.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":22,"uid":"zhcn:728fe5110323f5c8d35237e3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"いつもと同じですわ。\r\n私はただ、示すのみ。","source_fingerprint":"a27d3314c1240840199f6eb12e4c0c8c4a9643e2fab2f891dbfa7de75256b767","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20031"],"target_text":"Vẫn như mọi khi thôi.\r\nTôi chỉ việc chứng minh bằng hành động.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":23,"uid":"zhcn:f9e1ea27649723ab8a0c09ee","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"調子でしたら、お気になさらず。\r\nさ、まいりましょう。","source_fingerprint":"0602d87854d89562a87652687a9c579fe259597c7ebebf078e86d0eca0a9b5ac","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20032"],"target_text":"Nếu anh đang lo về trạng thái của tôi thì đừng bận tâm.\r\nNào, đi thôi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":24,"uid":"zhcn:2bef085ad53b450300493edd","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"多少の浮き沈みなど、\r\n埃が舞った程度のこと。","source_fingerprint":"cd953e3d16dd50f18105453019b46ca90bf3ce0fb03b841069e333eafedb5a8f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20033"],"target_text":"Chút thăng trầm thế này\r\nchỉ như bụi bay qua mà thôi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":25,"uid":"zhcn:8ed02b6a7cc1cc37ca3a0564","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"未完の調整は、本番を走りながら\r\n仕上げるといたしましょう。","source_fingerprint":"f913116d8a448ff2723058ecea3aea1b652b05358769e84fa559e1d9072754d2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20034"],"target_text":"Phần điều chỉnh còn dang dở\r\nthì cứ hoàn thiện trong lúc thi đấu thật thôi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":26,"uid":"zhcn:4157f1e628b26699ca388933","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"深き闇の中でこそ、\r\n輝きは増すものでしょう？","source_fingerprint":"b0178d24c653e8eafe9913d77a1822ceb7aad7d999a595f032992f966d973b6a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20035"],"target_text":"Chẳng phải chính trong bóng tối sâu thẳm\r\nánh sáng mới càng rực rỡ sao?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":27,"uid":"zhcn:d5e5163c20a939dedb47dec7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"調整不足？ほほほ…\r\n実に、些末な問題ですわ。","source_fingerprint":"03a04b5ac57766d28370fb2d30fb452b68def415b18f83fdab253f8dbe4d744b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20036"],"target_text":"Điều chỉnh chưa đủ? Hohoho…\r\nQuả là chuyện nhỏ nhặt.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":28,"uid":"zhcn:29f77e565d8d0d4f498f792f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"この状態でようやく、\r\n歯応えが生まれるというもの。","source_fingerprint":"0474a7394bf3991e1e4fc7ca966cbf7efb251ae9b28bdcd945dc013434f19521","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20037"],"target_text":"Ở trạng thái này thì cuối cùng\r\nmới có chút thử thách đáng kể.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":29,"uid":"zhcn:83d4d83701a3846b37822a94","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ふん！","source_fingerprint":"3b7f9d10469966733c1d50e88fa9e5ed490dba22d1f353e227a1fbc8b5c8e9bd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20038"],"target_text":"Hừ!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":30,"uid":"zhcn:418889f962094959e0d9216d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"さて。","source_fingerprint":"4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20039"],"target_text":"Nào.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":31,"uid":"zhcn:7b9c0aabd6fbcc940f44a305","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"よろしい。","source_fingerprint":"f61f2fb40e2660902b4fdecb54a607694cc2ff60520306ac36ae439fa4b91812","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1116","20040"],"target_text":"Tốt lắm.","reviewed":true},
